header: "---\nname: jake-whale-follow-up\ndescription: \"Follow-Up. Keeps the deal moving. Tells you who is due today after a pitch or an offer, drafts the next note (a bump, something useful, a last note), waits for your yes, logs it, and stops at the first \\\"no\\\", the moment a demo is booked, after 3 follow-ups or after 30 days. Logs their replies and knows when it's your turn. Use when the user says \\\"follow up\\\", \\\"who do I need to follow up with\\\", \\\"they haven't replied\\\", \\\"chase\\\", \\\"nudge\\\", \\\"bump this\\\", \\\"they replied\\\", \\\"they said no\\\", or every morning.\"\nlicense: MIT\nmetadata:\n  upstream_repository: Jakeschincariol/whale-skill\n  upstream_skill: follow-up\n  upstream_commit: 67390fc00e9c33f2d9f9ed5c3d52e330d520dc72\nprompt-source: prompt.toon\n---\n"
